    "notes": "Unfilled (natural) grade, equivalent to Victrex PEEK 450G. PEEK is semi-crystalline and has both a glass transition (Tg = 143°C, onset of amorphous softening) and a melting point (Tm = 343°C). Maximum continuous service temperature 250°C in air. Outstanding chemical resistance to most solvents, fuels, and acids. Filled grades (glass-fibre, carbon-fibre, PTFE) improve stiffness, creep resistance, and/or tribology at the cost of ductility. Thermal diffusivity derived from k, ρ, Cp."
